{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13210090","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13210090","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1321009001:1":{"text":"손님 여러분, 편히 앉아서 차를 즐겨주십시오.","source_cn":"各位客人，请不用客气，尽情品尝这杯茶吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA3B93E72C176DB25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1321009002:1":{"text":"기이한 웨이터, 이번에는 네가 채집한 찻잎으로 차를 만들었어.","source_cn":"奇花，这次我可是用了你采摘的茶叶。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA704801EDF9B119B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1321009003:1":{"text":"어, 그 꽃잎들로요...?","source_cn":"啊，你是说那些花瓣……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x16AD09E27EC02AEC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1321009004:1":{"text":"미스터 티포트, 지금 기이한 웨이터랑 화해하겠다는 거죠?","source_cn":"茶壶先生，你这算是在向奇花示好吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x740C2F6C932134F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1321009005:1":{"text":"크흠...! 그만 놀리시죠.","source_cn":"咳……！请您不要取笑我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46DB10DCEB934DF0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1321009006:1":{"text":"어쨌든 어서 한 잔 드셔 보시지요. 차가 식으면 맛과 향이 떨어질 테니까요.","source_cn":"总之，请各位先喝一杯茶吧。否则要是放凉了，口感和香味都...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x841E0E57064D910E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1321009007:1":{"text":"그 말이 맞네요. 그럼 치피는 사양하지 않을게요!","source_cn":"你说的有道理，那满满就不客气啦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x64D842D888549AE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1321009008:1":{"text":"음... 으음? 으으음!","source_cn":"唔……嗯？！嗯嗯嗯——！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8DFCC72FF269546","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1321009008":{"text":"음... 으음? 으으음!","source_cn":"唔……嗯？！嗯嗯嗯——！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8DFCC72FF269546","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1321009009:1":{"text":"치피, 일단 입에 머금은 찻물부터 뱉어!","source_cn":"满满，你先把嘴里的水吐出来吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x908B0947E255D5F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1321009010:1":{"text":"...마, 마스터! 이 차... 너무 써요!","source_cn":"……主、主人！这杯茶……好苦！！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4FDC21CF752331D5","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"...마, 마스터! 이 차... 너무 써요!","female":"...마, 마스터! 이 차... 너무 써요!","variant_male_record_index":"148982","variant_female_record_index":"148983","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1321009011:1":{"text":"그... 그럴 리가요!\n제가 직접 끓인 차라 쓸 리가 없습니다!","source_cn":"这……这怎么可能？！\\n这壶茶是我亲手泡的，怎么可能是苦的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26F5353DD8426EB5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1321009012:1":{"text":"여러분, 잠시만요. 제가 직접 맛을 보겠습니다!","source_cn":"各位先别着急，等我亲自尝一尝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x94D8242EDC5158D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1321009013:1":{"text":"...써!","source_cn":"——好苦！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF807028B2DEB4297","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1321009014:1":{"text":"봐요, 치피가 거짓말한 게 아니라고요!","source_cn":"你看，满满可没有骗你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB709A2AEA36D94C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1321009015:0":{"text":"이상하군요... 물 온도도 적당하고, 차를 끓이는 모든 과정도 정확히 지켰습니다. 찻잎에 곰팡이도 없었어요. 그런데 왜 쓴맛이 나는 걸까요?","source_cn":"奇怪……水温正好，泡茶的每个步骤都绝对符合规范，茶叶也...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD990115BB1AA137"